# NO LONGER READ, BUT ONCE: each chat has its own jobs now, changed with .jobs (add, del, toggle, run). As finbot
# starts the first time without them, it gives every home chat (telegramChatID, slackChannelID, discordChannelID) the
# jobs below (or those of the data directory's copy of this file), each in the zone it ran in, and reads this file no
# more. It goes once every install has done that (lib/migrate.py). The system jobs (sharesight_warm, yahoo_warm,
# cleanup) are not copied: they run on their own schedule, in lib/jobs.py.

# Every 20 minutes on weekdays
*/20 * * * Mon-Fri trades.py

# Mid-session
00 01 * * Mon-Fri price.py midsession # AU
15 17 * * Mon-Fri price.py midsession # US

# Daily
30  21 * * * reminder.py

# Daily on weekdays
29  21 * * Mon-Fri price.py interday
10  11 * * Mon-Fri price.py premarket

# Weekly
28  21 * * Sat cal.py earnings; cal.py ex-dividend; price.py 7; performance.py 7; rating.py

# Housekeeping: fetch afresh the Sharesight portfolio list and holdings every 30 minutes (cached 40 minutes) and the
# price histories of the stocks followed every 8 hours (cached 12 hours), so requests never wait on Sharesight or
# Yahoo; delete cache files older than 30 days
14,44 * * * * sharesight_warm.py
07 */8 * * * yahoo_warm.py
51  18 * * Sat cleanup.py 30

# Monthly
27  21 1 * * shorts.py; price.py 28; performance.py 28


